                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "8d346615-f27e-3c6b-a2d0-4ca7c6fac941",
                        "entry_id": "c4dbd88b-d75e-383a-8fd5-1ff8e992e0b5",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Hostile to white people or white culture."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "1b489c5d-34f4-4935-848f-248c05bd4724",
                                "sense_id": "8d346615-f27e-3c6b-a2d0-4ca7c6fac941",
                                "text": "In particular, the discussion is concerned with beliefs by blacks about whites, antiwhite and anti-Semitic attitudes."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "7a8639bf-58c7-4e81-924d-02442ff83c45",
                                "sense_id": "8d346615-f27e-3c6b-a2d0-4ca7c6fac941",
                                "text": "These and other questions were asked not to examine antiwhite feelings in depth — this would have required another study — but to build a rough index of antiwhite attitudes."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "e366d7b6-8e41-46ba-a6d3-58e8fac86b31",
                                "sense_id": "8d346615-f27e-3c6b-a2d0-4ca7c6fac941",
                                "text": "[…] choosing at this juncture to redefine himself in relation to an emerging black culture, a culture that was self-consciously antiwhite and, more significantly still, antinigger."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "804f0a58-2cec-44fe-b488-efdc78481f49",
                                "sense_id": "8d346615-f27e-3c6b-a2d0-4ca7c6fac941",
                                "text": "Vaché's rambuncious racelessness, which in practice translated into an antiwhite affirmation of other races, […]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "ddd4a4eb-302d-405f-a472-827e3b5adf19",
                                "sense_id": "8d346615-f27e-3c6b-a2d0-4ca7c6fac941",
                                "text": "When I speak publicly, I make a point of distinguishing between being antiwhite, which I am, and being unwhite, which I do not claim to have become."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "d0850cf4-f1b7-4aae-bd69-ede354c3aa18",
                                "sense_id": "8d346615-f27e-3c6b-a2d0-4ca7c6fac941",
                                "text": "West demonstrated that one can vociferously and unrelentingly condemn white supremacy as well as critically examine the harm it continues to inflict on black Americans without being antiwhite."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "304f5f8b-ab72-4421-a18d-44359f7814fe",
                                "sense_id": "8d346615-f27e-3c6b-a2d0-4ca7c6fac941",
                                "text": "Similarly, according to Blue Eyes, L.A. Law was little more than antiwhite propaganda: It was a real jewfest promoting multiculturalism and race mixing."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "80afbcc8-704e-465a-b7e4-ca3b797f85c3",
                                "sense_id": "8d346615-f27e-3c6b-a2d0-4ca7c6fac941",
                                "text": "For example, as one user noted: I am sick of self hating whites, white guilt, and multiculturalism which is jost ^([sic]) a codeword for antiwhite."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "26fdc2cd-299a-4001-ac2f-6b2125e09392",
                                "sense_id": "8d346615-f27e-3c6b-a2d0-4ca7c6fac941",
                                "text": "As Malcolm X so eloquently pronounced: \"If the present generation of whites would study their own race in the light of their true history, they would be anti-white themselves.\""
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "c8811166-714c-4883-978b-cde94aed53df",
                                "sense_id": "8d346615-f27e-3c6b-a2d0-4ca7c6fac941",
                                "text": "White nationalists recognize this as an opening. They hear antiracists' calls to “dismantle whiteness” and suggestions that we should be “less white” and they use our words against us as they claim that “antiracism is antiwhite.”"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "4104c6f1-e464-4c6c-a1ee-e46eb1341c25",
                        "source_entry_id": "c4dbd88b-d75e-383a-8fd5-1ff8e992e0b5",
                        "source_sense_id": "8d346615-f27e-3c6b-a2d0-4ca7c6fac941",
                        "source_sense_description": "opposed to white people",
                        "target_lang_word": "antiblanc",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "antiblanc",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "0add47f1-4d29-34bc-9145-b4d6cdd05f42",
                                        "entry_id": "2faf9142-9c45-3519-b6aa-fde585daab7e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Qui est hostile aux Blancs."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d14a9783-ba1f-44bc-8c87-05625f6f69dd",
                                                "sense_id": "0add47f1-4d29-34bc-9145-b4d6cdd05f42",
                                                "text": "Avec les échéances politiques, le climat antiblanc, anticolonial se durcit à la prison."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d40a4794-6017-40fd-8fd4-67a860909ff1",
                                                "sense_id": "0add47f1-4d29-34bc-9145-b4d6cdd05f42",
                                                "text": "On doit pouvoir dire qu'il y a un racisme antiblanc qui se développe chez certains Noirs. À taire les réalités, sous la dictature des antiracistes, on fait le jeu de l'extrême droite, nous le savons suffisamment quand même depuis 2002."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "01d4be18-2aad-4dd7-88f9-cb23b7b5b6a5",
                                                "sense_id": "0add47f1-4d29-34bc-9145-b4d6cdd05f42",
                                                "text": "Dans la zone contrôlée par le régime de Laurent Gbagbo, les violences antiblanches de novembre ont aggravé les difficultés."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "04f77253-8a7f-4144-88cf-5e8312912e95",
                                                "sense_id": "0add47f1-4d29-34bc-9145-b4d6cdd05f42",
                                                "text": "La réaction au racisme en Amérique du Nord, comme la lutte anticolonialiste en Afrique, étaient stigmatisées comme étant elles-mêmes racistes, tout acte de légitime défense étant perçu comme une agression antiblanche."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "df8010ef-089c-417a-8028-ad41af18ee1b",
                                                "sense_id": "0add47f1-4d29-34bc-9145-b4d6cdd05f42",
                                                "text": "Grande-Bretagne : Publication d'un Livre blanc sur le complot antiblanc du Nyassaland."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
